<%- include('header') %>
<p>
<a href="/prospects/<%= p.id %>">
<%= p.opp %> · <%= p.business_name %>
</a>
</p>
<h1>Pricing worksheet</h1>
<p>Josh-approved commercial worksheet. Hardware quoted separately. All personal phones count as zero managed business devices.</p>
<% if(p.hold){ %>
<div class="hold">On Hold — Pending Josh Review. Quote actions are blocked.</div>
<% } %>
<section class="card">
<h2>Monthly services · Pricing v20</h2>
<p>Managed IT includes SentinelOne EDR and Adlumin MDR. Monthly services and one-time onboarding are separate. No automatic volume discounts.</p>
<form method="post" action="/prospects/<%= p.id %>/quotes/managed" data-quote-calculator data-calculate-url="/prospects/<%= p.id %>/quotes/managed/calculate" data-preview-target="quote-calculation" data-status-target="quote-preview-status">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<fieldset <%= user.role!=='owner'||p.hold?'disabled':'' %>>
<div class="grid">
<div><label>Service</label><select name="serviceTier"><option value="managed">Managed IT — $125/user</option><option value="monitoring">Monitoring-Only — $45/device</option></select></div>
<div><label>Managed users</label><input type="number" name="users" min="0" required value="<%= managedInput.users||0 %>"></div>
<div><label>Monitoring-only devices</label><input type="number" name="monitoringDevices" min="0" required value="0"></div>
<div><label>Managed servers ($75/month)</label><input type="number" name="servers" min="0" required value="0"></div>
<div><label>Shared/additional devices ($15/month, Managed IT)</label><input type="number" name="extraDevices" min="0" required value="0"></div>
<div><label>Microsoft 365 backup users ($5/month)</label><input type="number" name="backupUsers" min="0" required value="0"></div>
<div><label>Monthly on-site block hours ($115/hour)</label><input type="number" name="onsiteHours" min="0" required value="0"></div>
<div><label>Business computers (owner review above 2/user)</label><input type="number" name="computers" min="0" required value="<%= managedInput.computers||0 %>"></div>
<div><label>Workstations requiring custom backup quote</label><input type="number" name="workstationBackups" min="0" required value="0"></div>
<div><label>Servers requiring custom backup quote</label><input type="number" name="serverBackups" min="0" required value="0"></div>
<div><label>One-time onboarding ($300–$750 guided)</label><input type="number" name="onboarding" min="0" step="0.01" value="0"></div>
</div>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I confirmed quantities, scope, and custom-price items.</label>
</fieldset>
<button <%= user.role!=='owner'||p.hold?'disabled':'' %>>Save managed services draft</button>
</form>
<p>On-site as needed: $125/hr subscribed, billed separately. Additional locations are scoped individually; no standard recurring location fee.</p>
</section>
<details class="card"><summary>Managed services estimate preview</summary><p>Adjust the fields above to preview monthly charges.</p><div id="quote-calculation"></div><p id="quote-preview-status" role="status"></p></details>
<details class="card" open><summary>BII implementation pricing · one-time project</summary>
<p>BII foundation, included allowances and additional-unit rates are calculated from the existing centrally configured BII prices. This is a one-time implementation estimate, not part of the monthly Managed IT total.</p>
<form method="post" action="/prospects/<%= p.id %>/quotes" class="card" data-quote-calculator data-calculate-url="/prospects/<%= p.id %>/quotes/calculate" data-preview-target="bii-quote-calculation" data-status-target="bii-preview-status">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<fieldset <%= user.role!=='owner'||p.hold?'disabled':'' %>>
<legend>Counts — Josh confirms these before approval</legend>
<p>Discovery computer counts start under platform not yet assigned. Move devices into platform rows without counting them twice. Uncaptured counts start at 0 and require Josh's confirmation.</p>
<div class="grid">
<% for(const [key,label] of [['users','Integration users'],['windows','Windows managed business devices'],['mac','Mac managed business devices'],['ios','Company iPhone/iPad managed devices'],['android','Company Android managed devices'],['unallocated','Managed business devices — platform not yet assigned'],['mailboxes','Straightforward mailbox migrations'],['dell','New Dell deployments (labor)'],['phones','Personal / BYOD phones — counted as 0'],['locations','Locations']]){ %>
<div>
<label>
<%= label %>
</label>
<input name="<%= key %>" type="number" min="0" max="100000" required value="<%= input[key] %>">
</div>
<% } %>
</div>
<h2>Priced by Josh</h2>
<p>OWNER ONE-OFF — NOT STANDARD UNIT PRICE for custom items below. Mirrored additional locations are calculated separately at 30% of the owner-confirmed repeatable BII implementation labor applicable to those locations.</p>
<div class="row">
<div>
<label>Additional mirrored location repeatable labor base</label>
<input type="number" step="0.01" min="0" name="locationLaborBase" value="<%= input.locationLaborBase??'' %>">
</div>
<p>When there is more than one additional mirrored location, enter the sum of the repeatable implementation labor base applicable to each additional location. Exclude hardware, software/licenses, Brownfield Remediation, migrations, Advanced Technology Assessment, and specialized/custom work.</p>
</div>
<% for(const [i,label] of oneOffItems.entries()){ %>
<div class="row">
<label>
<input type="checkbox" name="oneoff_<%= i %>" value="yes" <%= input.oneOff?.[label]?.selected?'checked':'' %>> <%= label %>
</label>
<div>
<label>Priced by Josh — amount</label>
<input type="number" step="0.01" min="0" name="amount_<%= i %>" value="<%= input.oneOff?.[label]?.amount??'' %>">
</div>
</div>
<% } %>
<label>
<input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" <%= input.confirmed?'checked':'' %> <%= user.role==='owner'?'required':'' %>> I have confirmed all counts, including zero values and devices counted once.</label>
</fieldset>
<button <%= p.hold?'disabled':'' %>>
<%= user.role==='owner'?'Save new draft':'Create draft from discovery for Josh' %>
</button>
</form>
<h3>BII project estimate preview</h3><div id="bii-quote-calculation"></div><p id="bii-preview-status" role="status"></p>
</details>
<section class="card">
<h2>Saved quote calculation</h2>
<p>Saved quote calculation (legacy implementation or managed services).</p>
<div>
<%- include('quote-calculation',{calculation}) %>
</div>
</section>
<% if(selected){ %>
<section class="card">
<h2>Quote #<%= selected.id %> · <%= selected.status %>
</h2>
<p>Approved by: <%= selected.approved_by||'Not approved' %> <%= selected.approved_at||'' %>
</p>
<a href="/quotes/<%= selected.id %>/print">Printable internal worksheet</a>
<% if(user.role==='owner'&&selected.status==='Draft'){ %>
<form method="post" action="/quotes/<%= selected.id %>/delete" data-confirm="Delete this draft quote? This cannot be undone.">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<button type="submit">Delete draft</button>
</form>
<form method="post" action="/quotes/<%= selected.id %>/approve">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<h3>Pre-quote stop conditions</h3>
<p>Tick any condition that applies. Any tick blocks approval: targeted assessment first.</p>
<% if(!input.confirmed){ %>
<label>
<input type="checkbox" name="confirm_counts" value="yes" required> I confirm the saved draft counts, including zero values and devices counted once.
</label>
<% } %>
<% for(const stop of stops){ %>
<label>
<input type="checkbox" name="stop_<%= stop.id %>" value="yes"> <%= stop.label %> · <%= stop.status %>
</label>
<% } %>
<label>
<input type="checkbox" name="reviewed" value="yes" required> I reviewed every stop condition.</label>
<button <%= p.hold?'disabled':'' %>>Approve pricing</button>
</form>
<% } %>
</section>
<% } %>
<details class="card">
<summary>Quote history</summary>
<% for(const q of quotes){ %>
<p>
<a href="/quotes/<%= q.id %>/print">#<%= q.id %> · <%= q.status %> · $<%= Number(q.total).toFixed(2) %>
</a>
</p>
<% } %>
</details>
<script src="/quote-calculator.js?v=20260930-1" defer></script>
<%- include('footer') %>